  "description": "Search fast and rent faster with Apartment List ΓÇô the most personalized way to apartment hunt. Tell us what you want in your next home, and discover premium apartments for rent in any city, curated just for you. Our Rental Matchmaker instantly filters through 1000s of rental apartments to guide you to the perfect one, so you love where you rent next.\n\nApartment List Key Features:\n\nRental Matchmaker Quiz\nOur 5-minute quiz saves you hours of searching for the perfect apartment. Answer a few questions about what youΓÇÖre looking for ΓÇô apartment size, amenities, location, budget, and more ΓÇô and weΓÇÖll instantly recommend premium rental apartments that match your preferences.\n\nAdjust your preferences at any time, and weΓÇÖll refresh your matches.\n\nCurated Apartment Matches\nWe sort your apartment matches into two categories: Perfect Matches and Flex Matches.\n\nPerfect Matches: Listings that have everything on your wishlist.\n\nFlex Matches: These listings may not match all your preferences, but you might find a few hidden gems. Our Flex Matches are based on local insights and similar searches from renters like you.\n\nSee an apartment for rent that you love? Swipe right and weΓÇÖll automatically add it to your shortlist. Hit ΓÇ£MaybeΓÇ¥ on the listings youΓÇÖre not sure aboutΓÇôweΓÇÖll save them so you can check them out later. \n\nAdditional Features: \n\nAmenity Focused Filters\nPersonalize your search even further with filters for everything: amenities, move-in dates, commute times, rent specials, lease lengths, and more!\n\nMap Searches\nDiscover Perfect Matches and Smart Matches in neighborhoods youΓÇÖll love to call home. Our in-map filters help you find rental apartments that fit your wishlist, budget, and location preferences.\n\nReal-Time Alerts\nGet updates on unit availability, price changes, or new rent specials on rental apartments saved to your shortlist. \n\n24/7 Availability and Tour Booking\nGet in touch with properties anytime, anywhere via phone, text, or email. Book an in-person or virtual tour from the app whenever youΓÇÖre ready to check out your favorite listings.\n\n\nOur premium apartment listings feature high-quality photos, virtual tours, and real-time updates on pricing, unit availability, and rent specials. We donΓÇÖt skip out on the fine print ΓÇô like pet policies and move-in fees ΓÇô so you know exactly what to expect before you rent.\n\nDownload Apartment List and find your perfect apartment match today. WeΓÇÖre always making improvements to our app to make your apartment search even better.\n\nHave questions or feedback for us? Email us at feedback@apartmentlist.com. WeΓÇÖd love to hear from you!",
